f0039.en:
English, so no translation. Revised 31 Oct 2026 by Andrew Beling's contribution (see beling/frame39/frame0039rereads.md), replacing the first reading of 27 Oct.

The page is a numerical copy of two things. L1-8 end Morris's cover letter of 4 January 1814 (dateline on frame 0038; in clear on M37 roll 2 frames 395-396). L9-26 begin the proposal it enclosed (in clear on M31 roll 14 frames 59-60). This reading uses the historical key (beling/key/) with the block reversal, and rereads of digits on the frame. The clear texts were in view during those rereads, so this is not a blind reading. Every reread is listed in beling/frame39/frame0039rereads.md. morris1813transcription.txt and morris1813decryption.txt are the 27 Oct files and are not changed.

Marks: "..." written in clear in the original; [?word] taken from the clear text, with groups that don't give it; [370] the unread group;
